agent	orchestrator-worker-discipline	ships	factory	no	presupposes the aif-handoff operator runtime (runtime-bridge dispatch / reviewer-session protocol) that only factory installs (setup.d/20-agents.sh:33-40)
agent	reviewer-discipline	ships	factory	no	presupposes the aif-handoff operator runtime (runtime-bridge dispatch / reviewer-session protocol) that only factory installs (setup.d/20-agents.sh:33-40)
agent	manual-rule-liveness-prober	internal	no	no	internal, because it is an authoring-only tool for getff's own rule liveness (#552)
agent	shipped-agent-liveness-prober	internal	no	no	internal, because it is an authoring-only probe of getff's shipped agents (M2, #552 sibling)
